===== Getting started  =====
  - if you have the breed bootloader version only, you can log on to the Unielec OpenWrt version and go to the upgrade page, load the OpenWrt 18.06.1 firmware and the work is done!!
  - please be aware that you loose the mmc reader function
  - with an LTE card installed, the usb port near the power plug don't work anymore - USB lines in miniPCIe and regular A-type socket are connected together, without any proper analog switch or USB HUB.

</WRAP>

