<WRAP BOX>

Numbers 1-4 are Ports 1-4 as labeled on the unit, number 0 is the Internet (WAN) on the unit, 6 is the internal connection to the router itself. vlan1 (lan) = eth0.1, vlan2 (wan) = eth0.2.
